  "issue": {
    "number": 1213,
    "state": "open",
    "body": "Promoted from P3 audit bundle #1193. Original findings:\n\n`ios/`, `macos/`: the first `flutter build ios --config-only --no-codesign` / `flutter build macos --config-only` on current stable modifies 11 tracked files (both `Podfile.lock`s, pbxproj, schemes, `AppDelegate.swift`, `Info.plist`) and adds two untracked `swiftpm/` dirs (SPM + UIScene migrators; patrol 4.11 ships a `Package.swift`). Criterion: on a fresh clone both commands leave `git status` clean - migrations committed or SPM pinned off deliberately, and documented.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- on a fresh clone both commands leave `git status` clean - migrations committed or SPM pinned off deliberately, and documented.\n- Required host checks and applicable workflow dispatches pass; evidence names each criterion. Parent #1193 is checked only after this issue closes.\n"
  },
